# The offline Postgres + PostGIS + pgvector image every database-backed test arm
# boots. This file is the ONE place the tag is written, because its consumers do
# not share a language: `src/postgres-image.ts` reads it for the two TypeScript
# fixtures and `scripts/local-gates/db-fresh-schema.sh` sources it as bash.
# `test/image-tag-contract.test.ts` resolves it through both and fails on drift.
#
# Build it once (the only step that needs network):
#   docker build -f apps/agent/docker/test-postgres/Dockerfile -t <this tag> .
TEST_POSTGRES_IMAGE=animichi-test-postgres:18-3.6-pgvector-0.8.5
